data: {"id": "00a77f3b002a4b08-thinking-parallel_evidence-3499", "run_id": "00a77f3b002a4b08", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据采集\n\n### 1. Pod 身份与当前状态\n- **kubectl_get_yaml**: 身份确认。Pod `workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h`，UID `f371c9da-cbaf-447f-8ec3-e90fd82caa5d`，命名空间 `aiops-case-08`，节点 `node2`。\n- **kubectl_get_by_name**: **当前状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`**，`0/1` Ready，重启次数 17 次，最后重启约 3-4 分钟前。\n- **kubectl_describe**: 关键诊断行显示 Reason: `OOMKilled`，Exit Code: `137`。事件确认 `Back-off restarting failed container app`。\n\n**事实**: 当前异常状态已确认，不是已恢复，仍处于 CrashLoopBackOff 中。\n\n### 2. 崩溃根因：OOMKilled 确认\n- **kubectl_describe / kubectl_get_yaml**: 容器 `ap", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788454322790, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

